"summary": "Elise Voss from the Communications department reports not receiving external emails since Monday, despite internal emails working and no bounce messages from authors. A check of the junk folder was performed, and one author confirmed their message did not bounce but still did not arrive. The gateway log shows accepted connections from inside Ashmere and no recent mail from the outside domains on the communications list. No bounce is generated when a message is dropped at the spam threshold.",
"suggestedCategory": "Email",
"followUps": [
"Can you confirm if the external domains are correctly listed in the communications settings?",
"What specific actions have been taken to resolve this issue so far?"
],
"draft": "Hello Elise Voss, \n\nThank you for bringing this issue to our attention. We have checked the gateway log and it shows that there are accepted connections from inside Ashmere and no recent mail from the outside domains on the communications list. We have also confirmed that no bounce messages are generated when a message is dropped at the spam threshold. \n\nCould you please confirm if the external domains are correctly listed in the communications settings? Additionally, could you let us know what specific actions have been taken to resolve this issue so far? We are committed to resolving this issue as soon as possible. \n\nBest regards, \nAshmere Press IT"
}

